WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:04.003
WERE HUNDREDS OF PROTESTERS

00:00:04.005 --> 00:00:05.666
GATHERING ONCE AGAIN TONIGHT,

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:06.793
BUT FIRST CHRISTINE FISHER AT

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:08.359
THE WHITE HOUSE WITH NEW

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.329
INFORMATION ON WHAT REALLY WENT

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.834
DOWN LAST NIGHT ON THE NORTH

00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:13.405
LAWN.

00:00:13.439 --> 00:00:15.563
&gt;&gt; MOMENTS AGO THE U.S. PARK

00:00:15.565 --> 00:00:17.131
POLICE PUT OUT A STATEMENT

00:00:17.165 --> 00:00:19.223
SAYING THAT NO TEAR GAS WAS USED

00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:21.047
DURING THAT TO PUSH BACK OF

00:00:21.081 --> 00:00:21.852
PROTESTERS IN LAFAYETTE SQUARE.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.338
THIS TIME LAST NIGHT.

00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:26.411
NOW DEMOCRATS ON CAPITOL HILL

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:28.412
SAYING THAT THOSE PROTESTERS

00:00:28.413 --> 00:00:30.092
WERE PEACEFUL, BUT THE PARK

00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:32.141
POLICE SAYING THAT SOME

00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:33.460
PROCESSORS -- PROTESTERS WERE

00:00:33.494 --> 00:00:35.086
COMBATIVE AND THROUGH

00:00:35.087 --> 00:00:36.850
PROJECTILES FORCING THEM TO

00:00:36.851 --> 00:00:37.666
ESCALATE.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.194
ONE DAY AFTER LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:00:40.195 --> 00:00:42.058
SAYING THAT THE RUBBER BULLETS

00:00:42.059 --> 00:00:46.498
ON PROTESTERS PAVE THE WAY FOR

00:00:46.499 --> 00:00:48.301
PRESIDENT TRUMP TO MAKE THIS

00:00:48.302 --> 00:00:51.386
WALK TO ST. JOHN’S CHURCH, THE

00:00:51.421 --> 00:00:53.283
PRESIDENT WAS BACK AT ANOTHER

00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:55.538
PLACE OF PRAYER, BUT THIS MOMENT

00:00:55.573 --> 00:00:56.904
OF REMEMBRANCE WAS QUICKLY

00:00:56.938 --> 00:00:58.324
FOLLOWED BY A SCATHING STATEMENT

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:00.041
FROM THE ARCHBISHOP OF

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:02.266
WASHINGTON WHO SAID I FIND IT

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.199
BAFFLING AND REPREHENSIBLE THAT

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.156
ANY CATHOLIC FACILITY WOULD

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.064
ALLOW ITSELF TO BE SO

00:01:08.098 --> 00:01:08.930
EGREGIOUSLY MISUSED AND

00:01:08.931 --> 00:01:09.628
MANIPULATED.

00:01:09.629 --> 00:01:14.061
AND TODAY OUTSIDE ST. JOHN’S

00:01:14.096 --> 00:01:14.537
CHURCH.

00:01:14.571 --> 00:01:15.180
--

00:01:15.182 --> 00:01:19.510
&gt;&gt; WE ARE HERE TO REPAIR.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.514
&gt;&gt; BUT KELLYANNE CONWAY SAYS

00:01:21.515 --> 00:01:22.766
PRESIDENT TRUMP HAS NOTHING TO

00:01:22.768 --> 00:01:23.403
REPENT FOR.

00:01:23.404 --> 00:01:25.780
&gt;&gt; WHY DID HE FEEL COMPELLED TO

00:01:25.781 --> 00:01:26.356
WALK THERE.

00:01:26.357 --> 00:01:29.513
THAT IS A SYMBOL TO EVERYONE

00:01:29.514 --> 00:01:31.989
THAT WE WILL NOT ALLOW ARSONISTS

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.501
AND ANARCHISTS WHO SET THE FIRE

00:01:33.502 --> 00:01:34.195
ABLAZE.

00:01:34.196 --> 00:01:36.219
&gt;&gt; ACCORDING TO A SENIOR

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.657
OFFICIAL, THE DECISION TO WIDEN

00:01:37.658 --> 00:01:38.421
THE PERIMETER AROUND THE

00:01:38.423 --> 00:01:41.480
WHITE HOUSE WAS MADE EARLY

00:01:41.481 --> 00:01:42.718
MONDAY MORNING, BUT WHEN

00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:43.715
ATTORNEY GENERAL BILL BARR

00:01:43.716 --> 00:01:45.710
ARRIVED IN LAFAYETTE SQUARE, THE

00:01:45.711 --> 00:01:48.911
PLAN HAD NOT YET BEEN EXECUTED.

00:01:48.912 --> 00:01:50.933
THE OFFICIAL CLAIMS A PROTESTER

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.443
THROUGH A WATER BOTTLE AT THE

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:54.207
ATTORNEY GENERAL, AND THAT’S

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:56.003
WHEN BILL BARR GAVE THE ORDER TO

00:01:56.005 --> 00:01:57.091
PUSH PROTESTERS BACK BEFORE

00:01:57.126 --> 00:02:00.290
PRESIDENT TRUMP WALKED OUT.

00:02:00.325 --> 00:02:02.512
SPEAK WITH THE POLICE DID NOT

00:02:02.513 --> 00:02:04.968
RESPOND OTHER THAN MOVING THE

00:02:04.969 --> 00:02:06.072
PROTESTERS BACK.

00:02:06.073 --> 00:02:09.846
BUT I THOUGHT WHAT THE PRESIDENT

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.182
DID AND THE CHURCH WAS NOT ONLY

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:14.518
APPROPRIATE, IT WAS NEEDED.

00:02:14.519 --> 00:02:15.819
&gt;&gt; SENATE MINORITY LEADER

00:02:15.821 --> 00:02:17.032
CHUCK SCHUMER CALLS IT

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.060
UNCONSTITUTIONAL, AND ABUSE OF

00:02:19.061 --> 00:02:20.581
PRESIDENTIAL POWER AND POSSIBLY

00:02:20.615 --> 00:02:21.332
ILLEGAL.

00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:23.096
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:26.265
UNITED STATES ORDERED TROOPS TO

00:02:26.299 --> 00:02:28.210
ATTACK PEACEFUL AMERICAN

00:02:28.245 --> 00:02:29.535
CITIZENS, EXERCISING THEIR

00:02:29.569 --> 00:02:31.851
CONSTITUTIONAL RIGHTS BY TEAR

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:35.323
GASSING THEM AT A PUBLIC PARK
WHILE MILITARY HELICOPTERS

00:02:35.357 --> 00:02:52.673
WHILE MILITARY HELICOPTERS
THROUGH

